  "description": "There’s nothing new about a passed-out guy at a bar. But when a judo champ and student walks home a cutie who’s had a few too many drinks, the athlete falls in love. After a hot night and a weird morning together, he discovers that the one-night stand is actually his music humanities professor—the neighbor who can’t keep his sex noises down at night. And the professor’s double shame of losing his musical ability and having a love affair with his student humiliates him even more, but the prof can’t keep his hands off the hot jock. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
